ProjectManager v0.1

This is our v0.1 so you can only manage projects, tasks, and user roles

- Allows the code to be able to distinguish between 'User', 'TeamMember', and 'Manager'.
- Allows a manager to create projects with a name, description, start date, and due date while making sure all the feilds are filled out.
- Allows the manager to add tasks to a project and update their status to 'Not Started', 'In Progress', or 'Completed'.
- Calculates  the overall project completion percentage based on tasks completed.

Main - Entry point that the user uses to access everything
User - Base class that rolw checks and credentials
Manager - Subclass of user that gives permissions to create and manage projects
TeamMember - Subclass of user that allows user to update statuses
Project - Creates a project, holds a list of tasks, and calculates overall progress
Task - Holds an individual task and manages its statuses
TaskStatus - Defines 'Not Started', 'In Progress', 'Completed'

How to run:
-Save all files into the same directory and open the code via the terminal
-The program will not use any user inputs but will run an input on its own to show that all the classes work.
